engine: duration sharing, fixed math and advance entries (Mudb0y runtime)

Ports the C entries the lifted languages call: advanc (scan advance),
move_f (double move as fixed), npush_f (fixed push), vdur_ass61 and
dur_ass61 with half_rounds_down (6.1's double-exact duration
sharing), the fixed_log/pow/exp/exp2 math in new
src/delta/delta_fixed.c (picked up by the Makefile wildcard), plus
delta.h declarations. No behaviour change alone: nothing in this
tree calls them yet; they exist so lifted rules resolve.

